1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,955
Kassa is an AI bookkeeper.

2
00:00:02,905 --> 00:00:07,142
You tell it, in three sentences, what it may do alone.

3
00:00:07,142 --> 00:00:11,286
Inside those limits it pays through PayPal Payouts.

4
00:00:11,286 --> 00:00:14,694
Outside them it brings the bill to you with the reason.

5
00:00:14,694 --> 00:00:19,707
Every decision is made by your rules; the model only writes the words.

